{"id": 384, "para": 216, "sentence": "$ {d \\over dt}g_{ij}(t) = - 2 R_{ij}, {P^{2n} \\over M_3} = H_3(M_1), H_3(M_1) = \\pi (\\chi, x) \\otimes h_{\\mu\\nu} $\n This equation built with quarks emerged with supersymmetry field of theorem.", "math": true, "tokens": ["d", "over", "dt", "g_", "ij", "t", "2", "R_", "ij", "P", "2n", "over", "M_3", "H_3", "M_1", "H_3", "M_1", "pi", "chi", "x", "otimes", "h_", "mu", "nu", "This", "equation", "built", "with", "quarks", "emerged", "with", "supersymmetry", "field", "of", "theorem"], "entropy": 4.843568731230678}
