{"id": 391, "para": 221, "sentence": "$$ i^2 = (0,1) \\cdot (0,1),|a||b|\\cos \\theta = -1, E = \\mathrm{div}(E,E_1) $$\n$$ \\left({\\{f,g\\} \\over [f,g]}\\right)^{'} = i^2,  E = mc^2, I^{'} = i^2 $$\nThis fermison of element decide with gravity of reflected for antigravity of power in average and gravity of mass,\nThis equals with differential metric to emerge with creature of existing materials.", "math": true, "tokens": ["i", "2", "0", "1", "cdot", "0", "1", "a", "b", "cos", "theta", "1", "E", "mathrm", "div", "E", "E_1", "left", "f", "g", "over", "f", "g", "right", "i", "2", "E", "mc", "2", "I", "i", "2", "This", "fermison", "of", "element", "decide", "with", "gravity", "of", "reflected", "for", "antigravity", "of", "power", "in", "average", "and", "gravity", "of", "mass", "This", "equals", "with", "differential", "metric", "to", "emerge", "with", "creature", "of", "existing", "materials"], "entropy": 5.205388011069908}
