{"id": 402, "para": 228, "sentence": "$$ {d \\over df}\\int \\int \\left({1 \\over (x \\log x)^2 \\circ (y \\log y)^{1 \\over 2}}\\right)dm  \\ge \\hbar $$\n\t$$ y = x, xy = x^2, (\\square \\psi)^{'} = 8 \\pi G\\left({p \\over c^3}\\circ{V \\over S}\\right) $$\n\tThis equation built with other dimension cover with universe of space, then three dimension \ninvite with fifth dimension out of these universe.", "math": true, "tokens": ["d", "over", "df", "int", "int", "left", "1", "over", "x", "log", "x", "2", "circ", "y", "log", "y", "1", "over", "2", "right", "dm", "ge", "hbar", "y", "x", "xy", "x", "2", "square", "psi", "8", "pi", "G", "left", "p", "over", "c", "3", "circ", "V", "over", "S", "right", "This", "equation", "built", "with", "other", "dimension", "cover", "with", "universe", "of", "space", "then", "three", "dimension", "invite", "with", "fifth", "dimension", "out", "of", "these", "universe"], "entropy": 5.1819187286732165}
{"id": 403, "para": 228, "sentence": "$$ \\square \\psi = \\int \\int \\mathrm{exp}[8 \\pi G(\\bar{h}_{\\mu\\nu}\\circ \\eta_{\\mu})^{\\nu}]dmd\\psi,\n\\sum a_k x^k = {d \\over df} \\sum\\sum {1 \\over a^2_kf^k}dx_k $$", "math": true, "tokens": ["square", "psi", "int", "int", "mathrm", "exp", "8", "pi", "G", "bar", "h", "_", "mu", "nu", "circ", "eta_", "mu", "nu", "dmd", "psi", "sum", "a_k", "x", "k", "d", "over", "df", "sum", "sum", "1", "over", "a", "2_kf", "k", "dx_k"], "entropy": 4.65057194545458}
