{"id": 638, "para": 352, "sentence": "\\section{Ultra Network from Omega DataBase worked with \\\\\nequation and category theorem from}\n  $$ ds^2 = [g_{\\mu\\nu}^2, dx] $$\n  This equation is constructed with $ M_2 $ of differential variable, this resulted non-commutative group theorem.", "math": true, "tokens": ["section", "Ultra", "Network", "from", "Omega", "DataBase", "worked", "with", "equation", "and", "category", "theorem", "from", "ds", "2", "g_", "mu", "nu", "2", "dx", "This", "equation", "is", "constructed", "with", "M_2", "of", "differential", "variable", "this", "resulted", "non", "commutative", "group", "theorem"], "entropy": 4.843568731230678}
{"id": 639, "para": 352, "sentence": "$$ ds^2 = g_{\\mu\\nu}^{-1}(g^2_{\\mu\\nu}(x) - dx g_{\\mu\\nu}^2) $$\n  In this function, singularity of surface in component, global surface of equation built with \n  $ M_2 $ sequence.", "math": true, "tokens": ["ds", "2", "g_", "mu", "nu", "1", "g", "2_", "mu", "nu", "x", "dx", "g_", "mu", "nu", "2", "In", "this", "function", "singularity", "of", "surface", "in", "component", "global", "surface", "of", "equation", "built", "with", "M_2", "sequence"], "entropy": 4.452819531114783}
{"id": 640, "para": 352, "sentence": "$$ = h(x) \\otimes g_{\\mu\\nu}d^2x - h(x) \\otimes dx g_{\\mu\\nu}(x),\n  h(x) = (f^2(\\vec{x}) - \\vec{E}^{+}) $$\n  $$ G_{\\mu\\nu} = R_{\\mu\\nu}T^{\\mu\\nu},\n   \\partial M_2 = \\bigoplus \\nabla C^{+}_{-} $$\n   $ G_{\\mu\\nu}  $ equal  $ R_{\\mu\\nu} $ , also Rich tensor equals  $ {d \\over dt}g_{ij} = - 2 R_{ij} $\n  This variable is also $ r = 2 f^{1 \\over 2}(x) $\n  This equation equals abel manifold, this manifold also construct fifth dimension.", "math": true, "tokens": ["h", "x", "otimes", "g_", "mu", "nu", "d", "2x", "h", "x", "otimes", "dx", "g_", "mu", "nu", "x", "h", "x", "f", "2", "vec", "x", "vec", "E", "G_", "mu", "nu", "R_", "mu", "nu", "T", "mu", "nu", "partial", "M_2", "bigoplus", "nabla", "C", "_", "G_", "mu", "nu", "equal", "R_", "mu", "nu", "also", "Rich", "tensor", "equals", "d", "over", "dt", "g_", "ij", "2", "R_", "ij", "This", "variable", "is", "also", "r", "2", "f", "1", "over", "2", "x", "This", "equation", "equals", "abel", "manifold", "this", "manifold", "also", "construct", "fifth", "dimension"], "entropy": 5.049024420865019}
{"id": 641, "para": 352, "sentence": "$$ E^{+} = f^{-1}xf(x), \n   h(x) \\otimes g(\\vec{x}) \\cong {V \\over S},\n  {R \\over M_2} = E^{+} - {\\phi} $$\n  $$ = M_3 \\supset R,\n   M^{+}_2 = E^{+}_{1} \\cup E^{+}_{2} \\to E^{+}_1 \\bigoplus E^{+}_2 $$\n  $$ = M_1 \\bigoplus \\nabla C^{+}_{-}, (E^{+}_{1} \\bigoplus E^{+}_{2}) \\cdot (R^{-} \\subset C^{+}) $$\n  Reflection of two dimension don't emerge in three dimension of manifold, then this space emerge with out of universe.", "math": true, "tokens": ["E", "f", "1", "xf", "x", "h", "x", "otimes", "g", "vec", "x", "cong", "V", "over", "S", "R", "over", "M_2", "E", "phi", "M_3", "supset", "R", "M", "_2", "E", "_", "1", "cup", "E", "_", "2", "to", "E", "_1", "bigoplus", "E", "_2", "M_1", "bigoplus", "nabla", "C", "_", "E", "_", "1", "bigoplus", "E", "_", "2", "cdot", "R", "subset", "C", "Reflection", "of", "two", "dimension", "don", "t", "emerge", "in", "three", "dimension", "of", "manifold", "then", "this", "space", "emerge", "with", "out", "of", "universe"], "entropy": 5.244803663125518}
{"id": 642, "para": 352, "sentence": "This mechanism also concern with entropy of non-catastrophe.", "math": false, "tokens": ["This", "mechanism", "also", "concern", "with", "entropy", "of", "non", "catastrophe"], "entropy": 3.169925001442312}
{"id": 643, "para": 352, "sentence": "$$ {R \\over M_2} = E^{+} - \\{\\phi\\} $$\n  $$ = M_3 \\supset R $$\n  $$ M^{+}_3 \\cong h(x) \\cdot R^{+}_3\n  = \\bigoplus \\nabla C^{+}_{-}, \n  R = E^{+} \\bigoplus M_2 - (E^{+} \\cap M_2) $$\n  $$ E^{+} = g_{\\mu\\nu}dxg_{\\mu\\nu},\n   M_2 = g_{\\mu\\nu}d^2x,\n   F = \\rho g l \\to {V \\over S} $$\n  $$ \\mathcal{O}(x) = \\delta(x)[f(x) + g(\\bar{x})] + \\rho g l,\n   F = {1 \\over 2}mv^2 - {1 \\over 2}kx^2,\n   M_2 = P^{2n} $$\n  This equation means not to be limited over fifth dimension of light of gravity.", "math": true, "tokens": ["R", "over", "M_2", "E", "phi", "M_3", "supset", "R", "M", "_3", "cong", "h", "x", "cdot", "R", "_3", "bigoplus", "nabla", "C", "_", "R", "E", "bigoplus", "M_2", "E", "cap", "M_2", "E", "g_", "mu", "nu", "dxg_", "mu", "nu", "M_2", "g_", "mu", "nu", "d", "2x", "F", "rho", "g", "l", "to", "V", "over", "S", "mathcal", "O", "x", "delta", "x", "f", "x", "g", "bar", "x", "rho", "g", "l", "F", "1", "over", "2", "mv", "2", "1", "over", "2", "kx", "2", "M_2", "P", "2n", "This", "equation", "means", "not", "to", "be", "limited", "over", "fifth", "dimension", "of", "light", "of", "gravity"], "entropy": 5.45221001602482}
