{"id": 705, "para": 392, "sentence": "$$ S^{mn}_1 \\otimes S^{mn}_2 = \\int [D^2 \\psi \\otimes h_{\\mu\\nu}]dm $$\n And this formula is D-brane on sheap of fields, also this equation construct \n with zeta function.", "math": true, "tokens": ["S", "mn", "_1", "otimes", "S", "mn", "_2", "int", "D", "2", "psi", "otimes", "h_", "mu", "nu", "dm", "And", "this", "formula", "is", "D", "brane", "on", "sheap", "of", "fields", "also", "this", "equation", "construct", "with", "zeta", "function"], "entropy": 4.741363816328152}
