{"id": 710, "para": 395, "sentence": "$$ {d \\over df}F = [\\nabla_{i}\\nabla_{j}\\int \\nabla f(x) d\\eta](U(r) + E^{+}_{-}) $$\n $$ = {1 \\over 2}mv^2 + mc^2 $$\n These equation conclude with this energy of relativity theorem come to resolve with.", "math": true, "tokens": ["d", "over", "df", "F", "nabla_", "i", "nabla_", "j", "int", "nabla", "f", "x", "d", "eta", "U", "r", "E", "_", "1", "over", "2", "mv", "2", "mc", "2", "These", "equation", "conclude", "with", "this", "energy", "of", "relativity", "theorem", "come", "to", "resolve", "with"], "entropy": 4.912272579176128}
