{"id": 715, "para": 400, "sentence": "$$ [f(x)] = \\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}a_kf^k, \\lim_{n \\to 1}[f(x)] = \\lim_{n \\to 1}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}a_kf^k $$\n The formula have with indicate to resolved with abel manifold to become of zeta function.", "math": true, "tokens": ["f", "x", "sum_", "k", "0", "infty", "a_kf", "k", "lim_", "n", "to", "1", "f", "x", "lim_", "n", "to", "1", "sum_", "k", "0", "infty", "a_kf", "k", "The", "formula", "have", "with", "indicate", "to", "resolved", "with", "abel", "manifold", "to", "become", "of", "zeta", "function"], "entropy": 4.362325295785325}
{"id": 716, "para": 400, "sentence": "$$ = \\alpha, e^{i\\theta} = \\cos \\theta + i\\sin \\theta, H_3(M_1) = 0 $$\n $$ {x^2 \\cos \\theta \\over a} +\n {y^2 \\sin \\theta \\over b} = r^2, \\begin{pmatrix} \\cos \\theta && - \\sin \\theta \\\\\n \\sin \\theta && \\cos \\theta \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} x \\\\\n y \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 && 0 \\\\\n 0 && - 1 \\end{pmatrix} $$\n $$ \\chi(x) = \\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty} (-1)^n r^n, {d \\over df}F = {d \\over df}\\sum\\sum a_kf^k $$\n $$ = |a_1a_2\\dots a_n| - |a_1 \\dots a_{n-1}| - |a_n \\dots a_1|, \\lim_{n \\to 0}\\chi (x) = 2 $$\n Euler function have with summuate of manifold.", "math": true, "tokens": ["alpha", "e", "i", "theta", "cos", "theta", "i", "sin", "theta", "H_3", "M_1", "0", "x", "2", "cos", "theta", "over", "a", "y", "2", "sin", "theta", "over", "b", "r", "2", "begin", "pmatrix", "cos", "theta", "sin", "theta", "sin", "theta", "cos", "theta", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "x", "y", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "1", "0", "0", "1", "end", "pmatrix", "chi", "x", "sum_", "k", "0", "infty", "1", "n", "r", "n", "d", "over", "df", "F", "d", "over", "df", "sum", "sum", "a_kf", "k", "a_1a_2", "dots", "a_n", "a_1", "dots", "a_", "n", "1", "a_n", "dots", "a_1", "lim_", "n", "to", "0", "chi", "x", "2", "Euler", "function", "have", "with", "summuate", "of", "manifold"], "entropy": 5.125797568623018}
{"id": 717, "para": 401, "sentence": "$$ \\lim_{n \\to 1}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}a_k f^k = {}_nC_{r}f(x)^nf(y)^{n-r} \\delta(x,y) $$\n $$ \\lim_{n \\to \\infty}{}_nC_{r}f(x)^nf(y)^{n-r} \\delta (x,y) $$\n Differential equation also become of summuate of manifold, and to get abel manifold.", "math": true, "tokens": ["lim_", "n", "to", "1", "sum_", "k", "0", "infty", "a_k", "f", "k", "_nC_", "r", "f", "x", "nf", "y", "n", "r", "delta", "x", "y", "lim_", "n", "to", "infty", "_nC_", "r", "f", "x", "nf", "y", "n", "r", "delta", "x", "y", "Differential", "equation", "also", "become", "of", "summuate", "of", "manifold", "and", "to", "get", "abel", "manifold"], "entropy": 4.493660689688186}
{"id": 718, "para": 401, "sentence": "$$ \\lim_{n \\to 1}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\left({1 \\over (n + 1)}\\right)^s = \\lim_{n \\to 1}Z^r = {1 \\over z} $$\n Native function also become of gamma function and abel manifold also zeta function.", "math": true, "tokens": ["lim_", "n", "to", "1", "sum_", "k", "0", "infty", "left", "1", "over", "n", "1", "right", "s", "lim_", "n", "to", "1", "Z", "r", "1", "over", "z", "Native", "function", "also", "become", "of", "gamma", "function", "and", "abel", "manifold", "also", "zeta", "function"], "entropy": 4.422442136473174}
