{"id": 721, "para": 402, "sentence": "$$ \\sum_{x=0}^{\\infty}f(x) \\to \\bigoplus_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\nabla f(x) = \\int_M \\delta(x)f(x)dx $$\n   Super function also needed to resolved with summuate of manifold.", "math": true, "tokens": ["sum_", "x", "0", "infty", "f", "x", "to", "bigoplus_", "k", "0", "infty", "nabla", "f", "x", "int_M", "delta", "x", "f", "x", "dx", "Super", "function", "also", "needed", "to", "resolved", "with", "summuate", "of", "manifold"], "entropy": 4.161406329721843}
{"id": 722, "para": 402, "sentence": "$$ \\int \\int \\int_M {V \\over S^2}e^{-f}dV = \\int \\int_D - (f(x,y)^2, g(x,y)^2) \n   - \\int \\int_D (g(x,y)^2, f(x,y)^2) $$\n   Three dimension of manifold developed with being resolved of surface with pression.", "math": true, "tokens": ["int", "int", "int_M", "V", "over", "S", "2", "e", "f", "dV", "int", "int_D", "f", "x", "y", "2", "g", "x", "y", "2", "int", "int_D", "g", "x", "y", "2", "f", "x", "y", "2", "Three", "dimension", "of", "manifold", "developed", "with", "being", "resolved", "of", "surface", "with", "pression"], "entropy": 4.2407810423835155}
{"id": 723, "para": 402, "sentence": "$$ \\lim_{n \\to 1}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}a_kf^k = \\int [D^2 \\psi \\otimes h_{\\mu\\nu}]dm $$\n   $$ = \\int \\mathrm{exp}[L(x)]d\\psi dm \\times E^{+}_{-} $$\n   $$ = S^{mn}_1 \\otimes S^{mn}_1 $$\n   $$ = Z_1 \\oplus Z_1$$\n   $$ = M_1 $$", "math": true, "tokens": ["lim_", "n", "to", "1", "sum_", "k", "0", "infty", "a_kf", "k", "int", "D", "2", "psi", "otimes", "h_", "mu", "nu", "dm", "int", "mathrm", "exp", "L", "x", "d", "psi", "dm", "times", "E", "_", "S", "mn", "_1", "otimes", "S", "mn", "_1", "Z_1", "oplus", "Z_1", "M_1"], "entropy": 4.918527614374182}
