{"id": 725, "para": 403, "sentence": "$$ H^m_n(\\chi,h) = \\int \\int_M {V \\over (R + \\Delta f)}e^{-f}dV, {V \\over S^2} = \\int \\int \\int_M[D^\\psi \n   \\otimes h_{\\mu\\nu}]dm $$\n   Represent theorem equals with differential and integrate equation.", "math": true, "tokens": ["H", "m_n", "chi", "h", "int", "int_M", "V", "over", "R", "Delta", "f", "e", "f", "dV", "V", "over", "S", "2", "int", "int", "int_M", "D", "psi", "otimes", "h_", "mu", "nu", "dm", "Represent", "theorem", "equals", "with", "differential", "and", "integrate", "equation"], "entropy": 4.815622570826658}
