{"id": 727, "para": 404, "sentence": "$$ \\int \\int_D - g(x,y)^2dm - \\int \\int_D -f(x,y)^2dm $$\n   $$ = - 2 R_{ij}, [f(x),g(x)] \\times [h(x),g^{-1}(x)] $$\n   $$ \\begin{vmatrix} D^m && dx \\\\\n   dx && \\partial^m \\end{vmatrix} \\begin{vmatrix} \\cos \\theta && - \\sin \\theta \\\\\n   \\sin \\theta && \\cos \\theta \\end{vmatrix} \\begin{vmatrix} x \\\\\n   y \\end{vmatrix} = \\begin{vmatrix} 1 && 0 \\\\\n   0 && - 1 \\end{vmatrix}^{1 \\over 2} $$\n   $$ (D^m,dx)\\cdot (\\cos \\theta, \\sin \\theta) \\times (dx, \\partial^m)\\cdot (\\cos \\theta, \\sin \\theta) $$\n   This equation control to differential operator into matrix formula.", "math": true, "tokens": ["int", "int_D", "g", "x", "y", "2dm", "int", "int_D", "f", "x", "y", "2dm", "2", "R_", "ij", "f", "x", "g", "x", "times", "h", "x", "g", "1", "x", "begin", "vmatrix", "D", "m", "dx", "dx", "partial", "m", "end", "vmatrix", "begin", "vmatrix", "cos", "theta", "sin", "theta", "sin", "theta", "cos", "theta", "end", "vmatrix", "begin", "vmatrix", "x", "y", "end", "vmatrix", "begin", "vmatrix", "1", "0", "0", "1", "end", "vmatrix", "1", "over", "2", "D", "m", "dx", "cdot", "cos", "theta", "sin", "theta", "times", "dx", "partial", "m", "cdot", "cos", "theta", "sin", "theta", "This", "equation", "control", "to", "differential", "operator", "into", "matrix", "formula"], "entropy": 4.790061324566005}
{"id": 728, "para": 404, "sentence": "$$ \\begin{pmatrix} 1 && 0 \\\\\n   0 && i \\end{pmatrix} \\beta(x,\\theta) \\begin{pmatrix} x \\\\\n   y \\end{pmatrix} $$\n   $$ = \\begin{pmatrix} i && 0 \\\\\n   0 && - 1 \\end{pmatrix} $$\n   $$ l = {\\sqrt{\\hbar G \\over c^3}}, \\sigma^m \\cdot \\begin{pmatrix} \\delta(x) && - 1 \\\\\n   1 && \\epsilon (x) \\end{pmatrix}^{1 \\over 2} = \\begin{pmatrix} i && 0 \\\\\n   0 && - i \\end{pmatrix} $$\n   String theorem also imaginary equation of pole with the fields of manifold.", "math": true, "tokens": ["begin", "pmatrix", "1", "0", "0", "i", "end", "pmatrix", "beta", "x", "theta", "begin", "pmatrix", "x", "y", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "i", "0", "0", "1", "end", "pmatrix", "l", "sqrt", "hbar", "G", "over", "c", "3", "sigma", "m", "cdot", "begin", "pmatrix", "delta", "x", "1", "1", "epsilon", "x", "end", "pmatrix", "1", "over", "2", "begin", "pmatrix", "i", "0", "0", "i", "end", "pmatrix", "String", "theorem", "also", "imaginary", "equation", "of", "pole", "with", "the", "fields", "of", "manifold"], "entropy": 4.564551409242825}
{"id": 729, "para": 404, "sentence": "$$ \\left({\\partial \\over \\partial \\tau}f(x,y,z)\\right)^{3'} = A^{\\mu\\nu} $$\n   $$ {d \\over dt}g_{ij}(t) = - 2 R_{ij} $$\n   Rich equation is all of top formula in integrate theorem.", "math": true, "tokens": ["left", "partial", "over", "partial", "tau", "f", "x", "y", "z", "right", "3", "A", "mu", "nu", "d", "over", "dt", "g_", "ij", "t", "2", "R_", "ij", "Rich", "equation", "is", "all", "of", "top", "formula", "in", "integrate", "theorem"], "entropy": 4.8625759375402735}
{"id": 730, "para": 404, "sentence": "$$ = (D^m,dx) \\cdot (\\cos \\theta, \\sin \\theta) \\times (dx, \\partial^m)\\cdot (\\cos \\theta, \\sin \\theta) $$\n      Dalanverle equation equals with abel manifold.", "math": true, "tokens": ["D", "m", "dx", "cdot", "cos", "theta", "sin", "theta", "times", "dx", "partial", "m", "cdot", "cos", "theta", "sin", "theta", "Dalanverle", "equation", "equals", "with", "abel", "manifold"], "entropy": 3.7409532604048397}
{"id": 731, "para": 405, "sentence": "$$ \\lim_{n \\to 1}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}a_k f^k = \\lim_{n \\to 1} {a_n \\over a_{n-1}} \\cong \\alpha $$\n   $$ \\lim_{n \\to 1} \\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}{a_k \\over a_{k+1}} = \\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}a_k f^k $$\n   $$ \\square = {8 \\pi G \\over c^4}T^{\\mu\\nu} $$\n   $$ \\int x \\log x dx = \\int \\int_M(e^{x \\log x}\\sin \\theta d \\theta)dx d \\theta $$\n   $$ = (\\log \\sin \\theta d \\theta)^{1 \\over 2} - (\\delta(x) \\cdot \\epsilon (x))^{1 \\over 2} $$\n   Flow to energy into other dimension rout of equation, zeta function stimulate in epsilon-delta metric,\nand this equation construct with minus of theorem.", "math": true, "tokens": ["lim_", "n", "to", "1", "sum_", "k", "0", "infty", "a_k", "f", "k", "lim_", "n", "to", "1", "a_n", "over", "a_", "n", "1", "cong", "alpha", "lim_", "n", "to", "1", "sum_", "k", "0", "infty", "a_k", "over", "a_", "k", "1", "sum_", "k", "0", "infty", "a_k", "f", "k", "square", "8", "pi", "G", "over", "c", "4", "T", "mu", "nu", "int", "x", "log", "x", "dx", "int", "int_M", "e", "x", "log", "x", "sin", "theta", "d", "theta", "dx", "d", "theta", "log", "sin", "theta", "d", "theta", "1", "over", "2", "delta", "x", "cdot", "epsilon", "x", "1", "over", "2", "Flow", "to", "energy", "into", "other", "dimension", "rout", "of", "equation", "zeta", "function", "stimulate", "in", "epsilon", "delta", "metric", "and", "this", "equation", "construct", "with", "minus", "of", "theorem"], "entropy": 5.479773096005798}
