{"id": 970, "para": 504, "sentence": "$$ \\nabla(\\square \\psi)^{'} = [\\nabla_{i}\\nabla_{j} \\int \\nabla f(x) d \\eta]\n  ^{{1 \\over 2}+ iy} $$\n  $$ \\left(f(x), g(x) \\right)^{'} = (A^{\\mu\\nu})^{'} $$\n  $$ \\begin{pmatrix} dx & \\delta(x) \\\\\n  \\epsilon(x) & \\partial x \\end{pmatrix} \\cdot \\left(f(x,y), g(x,y)\\right) $$\n  $$ = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\\n  0 & - 1 \\end{pmatrix} $$\n  Differential equation of complex variable developed from imaginary and reality constance.", "math": true, "tokens": ["nabla", "square", "psi", "nabla_", "i", "nabla_", "j", "int", "nabla", "f", "x", "d", "eta", "1", "over", "2", "iy", "left", "f", "x", "g", "x", "right", "A", "mu", "nu", "begin", "pmatrix", "dx", "delta", "x", "epsilon", "x", "partial", "x", "end", "pmatrix", "cdot", "left", "f", "x", "y", "g", "x", "y", "right", "begin", "pmatrix", "1", "0", "0", "1", "end", "pmatrix", "Differential", "equation", "of", "complex", "variable", "developed", "from", "imaginary", "and", "reality", "constance"], "entropy": 5.106832812961887}
