{"id": 978, "para": 508, "sentence": "$$ (E_2 \\bigoplus E_2) \\cdot (R^{-} \\subset C^{+})  = \\bigoplus \\nabla C^{+}_{-} $$\nZeta function radius with field of mechanism for atom of pole into strong condition of balance,\nthis condition is related with quarks of level controlled for compute with quantum tonnel effective mechanism.", "math": true, "tokens": ["E_2", "bigoplus", "E_2", "cdot", "R", "subset", "C", "bigoplus", "nabla", "C", "_", "Zeta", "function", "radius", "with", "field", "of", "mechanism", "for", "atom", "of", "pole", "into", "strong", "condition", "of", "balance", "this", "condition", "is", "related", "with", "quarks", "of", "level", "controlled", "for", "compute", "with", "quantum", "tonnel", "effective", "mechanism"], "entropy": 4.85056969651225}
