{"id": 986, "para": 512, "sentence": "UFO mechanism are several system of circumstance that accesority and verisity composite with\nmass and circumemt of gravity is key of mechanism included with anti-gravity in imaginary pole \nemerge with rotate of right formula.", "math": false, "tokens": ["UFO", "mechanism", "are", "several", "system", "of", "circumstance", "that", "accesority", "and", "verisity", "composite", "with", "mass", "and", "circumemt", "of", "gravity", "is", "key", "of", "mechanism", "included", "with", "anti", "gravity", "in", "imaginary", "pole", "emerge", "with", "rotate", "of", "right", "formula"], "entropy": 4.593429088311723}
{"id": 987, "para": 512, "sentence": "This power of rotate emerge with anti-gravity which of power\nemelite for inner into oneselves create with like of lorentz of energy.", "math": false, "tokens": ["This", "power", "of", "rotate", "emerge", "with", "anti", "gravity", "which", "of", "power", "emelite", "for", "inner", "into", "oneselves", "create", "with", "like", "of", "lorentz", "of", "energy"], "entropy": 4.001822825622231}
