{"id": 1071, "para": 531, "sentence": "$$ \\pi(V_{\\tau}) = {e^{-(\\sqrt{\\pi \\over 16}\\log x)}}^{\\delta} \\times {1 \\over (x \\log x)} $$\n Universe of rout, Volume in expanding space time.", "math": true, "tokens": ["pi", "V_", "tau", "e", "sqrt", "pi", "over", "16", "log", "x", "delta", "times", "1", "over", "x", "log", "x", "Universe", "of", "rout", "Volume", "in", "expanding", "space", "time"], "entropy": 4.213660689688184}
{"id": 1072, "para": 531, "sentence": "$$ {d \\over dt}(g_{ij})^2 = {1 \\over 24}(F^m_t)^2 $$\n $$ m^2 = 2 \\pi T \\left({26 - D_n \\over 24}\\right) $$\n This quarks of mass in relativity theorem, and fourth of universe in three manifold of one dimension surface,\n and also this integrate of dimension in conbuilt of quarks.", "math": true, "tokens": ["d", "over", "dt", "g_", "ij", "2", "1", "over", "24", "F", "m_t", "2", "m", "2", "2", "pi", "T", "left", "26", "D_n", "over", "24", "right", "This", "quarks", "of", "mass", "in", "relativity", "theorem", "and", "fourth", "of", "universe", "in", "three", "manifold", "of", "one", "dimension", "surface", "and", "also", "this", "integrate", "of", "dimension", "in", "conbuilt", "of", "quarks"], "entropy": 4.944593665917306}
