{"id": 1946, "para": 762, "sentence": "$$ \\chemfig{*6(=-=-=-)(-[:180]CH_2-[:180]CH-[:180]OH-([:180]C=[:90]O)-[:180]OH)} + \\chemfig{2 NH_4^{+}}\n \\to \\chemfig{*6(=-(-Me)=-(-Me)=-(-Me))(-[:180]CH-[:180]OH-([:180]C=[:90]O)-[:180]OH)} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{*6(=-=-=-)-CH_2-CH-(-[:90]OH-(C(=[:90]O-([:180]OH))))} + \\chemfig{2 NH_4^{+}} \n \\to \\chemfig{*6(=-(-Me)=-(-Me)=-(-Me))-([:180]CH-OH-COOH)} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{*6(=-=-=-)-(-[:125]CH_2-([:125]CH-([:-90]OH-(C(=[:-90]O)-([:-125]OH)))))} + \\chemfig{2 NH_4^{+}} \n \\to \\chemfig{*6(=-(-Me)=-(-Me)=-(-Me))-([:125]CH_2-([:125]CH-(C(=[:-90]O-([:125]OH)))))} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{*6(=-=-=-)-(-[:-125]CH_2-([:-125]CH)-([:90]OH)-(C(=[:-90]O)-([:125]OH)))} + \\chemfig{2 NH_4^{+}}\n \\to \\chemfig{*6(=-(-Me)=-(-Me)=-(-Me))-(-[:-125]CH_2)-CH(-[:90]OH)-([:-90]CH_3)-([:-125]COOH)} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{*6(=-=-=-)-(-[:-165]CH_2-CH(-[:90]OH)-(C(=[:-90]O)-([:165]OH)))} + \\chemfig{2 NH_4^{+}} \n \\to \\chemfig{*6(=-(-Me)=-(-Me)=-(-Me))-(-[:-165]C-(-[:90]CH_2-[:-45]OH)-(-[:-90]CH_3)-(-[:-165]COOH))} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{*6(=-=-=-)-(-CH_2-CH-([:90]-OH)-(C(=[:-90]O)-OH))} + \\chemfig{2 NH_4^{+}} \n \\to \\chemfig{*6(=-(-Me)=-(-Me)=-(-Me))-C-(-[:90]CH_2-OH)-(-[:-90]CH_3)-COOH} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{*6(=-(-CH_2)-*6(=-[:45]CH)-*6(-[:90]OH)-(-C(=[:-90]O)-OH))} + \\chemfig{2 NH_4^{+}}\n \\to \\chemfig{*6(-(-Me)=-(-Me)=-(-Me))-*6(-[:165]C-(-[:-90]CH_3)-[:90]CH_2-(-OH)-(-[:-45]COOH))} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{*6(-(-NH_2)=-(-[:30]NH_2)=-(-[:135]NH_2)=)} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{*6(-NH_2=-NH_2=-NH_2=-)} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{[:30]*6(=-(NH_2-*6(=-*6(=-NH_2))=*6(-NH_2=-)))}+ \\chemfig{[:-45]3OH-*6(-=-=-=)}\n \\to \\chemfig{*6(-=-=-=)-[:-125]NH-O-CH_3}$$\n $$ \\chemfig{*6(=-(-H_2N-[,,1]=(-NH_2)-)=-=-)} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{H_2N-*6(=-(NH_2-*6(=-NH_2)-=-=)-)} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{[:30]*6(=-(-N=N-*6(-*6(-=0=0)=-=-(-HO)=))=-=-)} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{*6(-=-=-=)} \\chemfig{**6(------)} $$\n $$ \\chemfig{C?", "math": true, "tokens": ["chemfig", "6", "180", "CH_2", "180", "CH", "180", "OH", "180", "C