{"id": 2045, "para": 789, "sentence": "$$ H \\Psi = \\bigoplus (i \\hbar ^{\\nabla})^{\\oplus L} $$\n    $$ = \\bigoplus {{ H \\Psi} \\over \\nabla L} $$\n    $$ = e^{x \\log x} = x^{(x)^{'}} $$\n    however,\n    とすると、\n    $$ {d \\over df}F = m(x) $$\n    and gravity equation in being abled to existed with quantum physics,\n    and this physics is also represented with quantum level of differential\n    geometry.", "math": true, "tokens": ["H", "Psi", "bigoplus", "i", "hbar", "nabla", "oplus", "L", "bigoplus", "H", "Psi", "over", "nabla", "L", "e", "x", "log", "x", "x", "x", "however", "とすると", "d", "over", "df", "F", "m", "x", "and", "gravity", "equation", "in", "being", "abled", "to", "existed", "with", "quantum", "physics", "and", "this", "physics", "is", "also", "represented", "with", "quantum", "level", "of", "differential", "geometry"], "entropy": 5.052628469923718}
