{"id": 2050, "para": 790, "sentence": "Quantum level of differential geomerty is also resulted with\n    Gamma function of global differential manifold of values, Heisenberg\n    equation is alos resulted with global integrate manifold and this\n    quantum level of differential geometry is manifold of deprive of formula.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Quantum", "level", "of", "differential", "geomerty", "is", "also", "resulted", "with", "Gamma", "function", "of", "global", "differential", "manifold", "of", "values", "Heisenberg", "equation", "is", "alos", "resulted", "with", "global", "integrate", "manifold", "and", "this", "quantum", "level", "of", "differential", "geometry", "is", "manifold", "of", "deprive", "of", "formula"], "entropy": 4.316826898072059}
{"id": 2051, "para": 790, "sentence": "$$ |\\psi(t)\\rangle_s = e^{-i\\Hat{H} t}|\\Psi\\rangle_{H},\n    \\Hat{A}_s = \\Hat{A}_H(0) $$\n    $$ |\\Psi(t)\\rangle_s \\to {d \\over dt} $$\n    $$ i {d \\over dt}|\\psi (t) \\rangle_s = \\Hat{H}|\\psi(t)\\rangle_s $$\n    $$ \\langle\\Hat{A}(t)\\rangle = \\langle\\Psi(t)|\\Hat{A}(0)|\\Psi(t)\\rangle  $$\n    $$ {d \\over dt}\\Hat{A} = {1 \\over i}[\\Hat{A},H] $$\n    $$ \\Hat{A}(t) = e^{i\\Hat{H}t}\\Hat{A}(0)e^{-i\\Hat{H}t} $$\n    $$ \\lim_{\\theta \\to 0} \\begin{pmatrix} \\sin \\theta \\\\\n    \\cos \\theta \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} \\theta & 1 \\\\\n    1 & \\theta \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} \\cos \\theta \\\\\n    \\sin \\theta \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\\n    0 & - 1 \\end{pmatrix} $$\n    $$ f^{-1}(x) x f(x) = I^{'}_m, I^{'}_m = [1,0] \\times [0,1] $$", "math": true, "tokens": ["psi", "t", "rangle_s", "e", "i", "Hat", "H", "t", "Psi", "rangle_", "H", "Hat", "A", "_s", "Hat", "A", "_H", "0", "Psi", "t", "rangle_s", "to", "d", "over", "dt", "i", "d", "over", "dt", "psi", "t", "rangle_s", "Hat", "H", "psi", "t", "rangle_s", "langle", "Hat", "A", "t", "rangle", "langle", "Psi", "t", "Hat", "A", "0", "Psi", "t", "rangle", "d", "over", "dt", "Hat", "A", "1", "over", "i", "Hat", "A", "H", "Hat", "A", "t", "e", "i", "Hat", "H", "t", "Hat", "A", "0", "e", "i", "Hat", "H", "t", "lim_", "theta", "to", "0", "begin", "pmatrix", "sin", "theta", "cos", "theta", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "theta", "1", "1", "theta", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "cos", "theta", "sin", "theta", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "1", "0", "0", "1", "end", "pmatrix", "f", "1", "x", "x", "f", "x", "I", "_m", "I", "_m", "1", "0", "times", "0", "1"], "entropy": 4.657594423968615}
{"id": 2052, "para": 791, "sentence": "$$ {x + y} \\ge \\sqrt{x y} $$\n    $$ {x^{{1 \\over 2} + iy} \\over e^{x \\log x}} = 1 $$\n    $$ \\mathcal{O}(x) = \\nabla_i \\nabla_j \\int e^{{2 \\over m}\\sin \\theta \n    \\cos \\theta } \\times {{N \\mathrm{mod}(e^{x \\log x})} \\over {O(x)(x +\n    \\Delta |f|^2)^{1 \\over 2}}} $$\n    $$ x \\Gamma(x) = 2 \\int|\\sin 2 \\theta|^2 d \\theta, \\mathcal{O}(x)\n    = m(x)[D^2 \\psi] $$\n    $$ i^2 = (0,1) \\cdot (0,1), |a||b|\\cos \\theta = - 1 $$\n    $$ E = \\mathrm{div}(E, E_1) $$\n    $$ \\left({\\{f,g\\}} \\over [f,g] \\right) = i^2, E = mc^2, I^{'} = i^2 $$\n    ガンマ関数の大域的微分方程式は、ガンマ関数の初期関数についての\n    微分方程式でもあり、宇宙と異次元についてのビッグス場からの\n    ゼータ関数の生成も、３次元多様体の特異点定理になっている。", "math": true, "tokens": ["x", "y", "ge", "sqrt", "x", "y", "x", "1", "over", "2", "iy", "over", "e", "x", "log", "x", "1", "mathcal", "O", "x", "nabla_i", "nabla_j", "int", "e", "2", "over", "m", "sin", "theta", "cos", "theta", "times", "N", "mathrm", "mod", "e", "x", "log", "x", "over", "O", "x", "x", "Delta", "f", "2", "1", "over", "2", "x", "Gamma", "x", "2", "int", "sin", "2", "theta", "2", "d", "theta", "mathcal", "O", "x", "m", "x", "D", "2", "psi", "i", "2", "0", "1", "cdot", "0", "1", "a", "b", "cos", "theta", "1", "E", "mathrm", "div", "E", "E_1", "left", "f", "g", "over", "f", "g", "right", "i", "2", "E", "mc", "2", "I", "i", "2", "ガンマ関数の大域的微分方程式は", "ガンマ関数の初期関数についての", "微分方程式でもあり", "宇宙と異次元についてのビッグス場からの", "ゼータ関数の生成も", "次元多様体の特異点定理になっている"], "entropy": 5.004088879927644}
{"id": 2053, "para": 791, "sentence": "宇宙と異次元の片方でも同じ解にもなっている。", "math": false, "tokens": ["宇宙と異次元の片方でも同じ解にもなっている"], "entropy": 0.0}
{"id": 2054, "para": 791, "sentence": "逆三角関数の双曲多様体もヒッグス場の密度エネルギーの値と同じ\n    解にもなっている。", "math": false, "tokens": ["逆三角関数の双曲多様体もヒッグス場の密度エネルギーの値と同じ", "解にもなっている"], "entropy": 1.0}
{"id": 2055, "para": 791, "sentence": "微分幾何の量子化も、ゼータ関数の対極\n    する量子群と同じ解にもなっている。", "math": false, "tokens": ["微分幾何の量子化も", "ゼータ関数の対極", "する量子群と同じ解にもなっている"], "entropy": 1.584962500721156}
{"id": 2056, "para": 791, "sentence": "ゼータ関数は、量子群の方程式\n    についての対極に位置する大域的微分多様体の解にもなっている。", "math": false, "tokens": ["ゼータ関数は", "量子群の方程式", "についての対極に位置する大域的微分多様体の解にもなっている"], "entropy": 1.584962500721156}
{"id": 2057, "para": 791, "sentence": "Gamma function of global differential equation is first of differential\n    function deprivate with ordinary differential equations, more also\n    universe and other dimensiion of Higgs field emerge with zeta function,\n    more spectrum focus is three dimension of manifold of singularity or pair\n    theorem, and universe and other dimension of each value equals.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Gamma", "function", "of", "global", "differential", "equation", "is", "first", "of", "differential", "function", "deprivate", "with", "ordinary", "differential", "equations", "more", "also", "universe", "and", "other", "dimensiion", "of", "Higgs", "field", "emerge", "with", "zeta", "function", "more", "spectrum", "focus", "is", "three", "dimension", "of", "manifold", "of", "singularity", "or", "pair", "theorem", "and", "universe", "and", "other", "dimension", "of", "each", "value", "equals"], "entropy": 4.853318724112334}
{"id": 2058, "para": 791, "sentence": "This reverse of circle function of manifolds is also Higgs fields of \n    dense of entropy and result equation.", "math": false, "tokens": ["This", "reverse", "of", "circle", "function", "of", "manifolds", "is", "also", "Higgs", "fields", "of", "dense", "of", "entropy", "and", "result", "equation"], "entropy": 3.7254805569978675}
{"id": 2059, "para": 791, "sentence": "And differential structure of quantum\n    level in gravity is poled with zeta function and quantum group in high \n    result values.", "math": false, "tokens": ["And", "differential", "structure", "of", "quantum", "level", "in", "gravity", "is", "poled", "with", "zeta", "function", "and", "quantum", "group", "in", "high", "result", "values"], "entropy": 4.1219280948873624}
{"id": 2060, "para": 791, "sentence": "Zeta funtion and quantum group is Global differential\n    manifold of result in values.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Zeta", "funtion", "and", "quantum", "group", "is", "Global", "differential", "manifold", "of", "result", "in", "values"], "entropy": 3.7004397181410926}
{"id": 2061, "para": 791, "sentence": "$$ {d \\over d \\gamma} \\Gamma = m(x) $$\n    $$ = e^{- x \\log x} $$\n    $$ \\sin i x = {{e^{-x} + e^{x}} \\over 2i} $$\n    $$ {d \\over df}F = m(x) = e^{f} + e^{-f} $$\n    $$ = 2 i \\sin (i {x \\log x}) $$", "math": true, "tokens": ["d", "over", "d", "gamma", "Gamma", "m", "x", "e", "x", "log", "x", "sin", "i", "x", "e", "x", "e", "x", "over", "2i", "d", "over", "df", "F", "m", "x", "e", "f", "e", "f", "2", "i", "sin", "i", "x", "log", "x"], "entropy": 3.522868825253058}
{"id": 2062, "para": 792, "sentence": "Hyper circle function is constructed with sheap of manifold in \n    Beta function of reverse system emerged from Gamma fucntion \n    and reverse of circle function of entropy value,\n    and this reverse of hyper circle function of beta system\n    is universe and the other dimension of zeta function,\n    more over spectrum focus is this beta function of reverse in\n    circle function is quantum level of differential structure oneselves,\n    and this quantum level is also gamma function themselves.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Hyper", "circle", "function", "is", "constructed", "with", "sheap", "of", "manifold", "in", "Beta", "function", "of", "reverse", "system", "emerged", "from", "Gamma", "fucntion", "and", "reverse", "of", "circle", "function", "of", "entropy", "value", "and", "this", "reverse", "of", "hyper", "circle", "function", "of", "beta", "system", "is", "universe", "and", "the", "other", "dimension", "of", "zeta", "function", "more", "over", "spectrum", "focus", "is", "this", "beta", "function", "of", "reverse", "in", "circle", "function", "is", "quantum", "level", "of", "differential", "structure", "oneselves", "and", "this", "quantum", "level", "is", "also", "gamma", "function", "themselves"], "entropy": 4.856900650634803}
{"id": 2063, "para": 792, "sentence": "This gamma fucntion is more also D-brane and anti-D-brane built \n    with supplicant values.", "math": false, "tokens": ["This", "gamma", "fucntion", "is", "more", "also", "D", "brane", "and", "anti", "D", "brane", "built", "with", "supplicant", "values"], "entropy": 3.75}
{"id": 2064, "para": 792, "sentence": "Higgs fileds is more also pair of universe and\n    other dimension each other value elements.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Higgs", "fileds", "is", "more", "also", "pair", "of", "universe", "and", "other", "dimension", "each", "other", "value", "elements"], "entropy": 3.773557262275185}
{"id": 2065, "para": 792, "sentence": "逆三角関数の双曲多様体は、ガンマ関数の方程式からの導出での\n    ベータ関数の逆三角関数のエントロピー値にもなっている。", "math": false, "tokens": ["逆三角関数の双曲多様体は", "ガンマ関数の方程式からの導出での", "ベータ関数の逆三角関数のエントロピー値にもなっている"], "entropy": 1.584962500721156}
