{"id": 2069, "para": 794, "sentence": "$$ {\\partial \\over \\partial f}F(x) = \\int \\int \\text{cohom}D_k(x)[I_m]  $$\n Cohomology element is constructed with isotopy of D-brane,\n and this isotopy of symmetry structure is sheaf of manifold,\n more over this brane of element is double integrate of projection.", "math": true, "tokens": ["partial", "over", "partial", "f", "F", "x", "int", "int", "text", "cohom", "D_k", "x", "I_m", "Cohomology", "element", "is", "constructed", "with", "isotopy", "of", "D", "brane", "and", "this", "isotopy", "of", "symmetry", "structure", "is", "sheaf", "of", "manifold", "more", "over", "this", "brane", "of", "element", "is", "double", "integrate", "of", "projection"], "entropy": 4.673601313385812}
{"id": 2070, "para": 794, "sentence": "$$ {\\partial \\over \\partial f}F = {{}^t \\variint} \\text{cohom}D_k(x)^{\\ll p} $$\n And global partial defferential equation is integrate of cut in cohomolgy,\n and this step of defferential D-brane of sheap value is varint of equals,\n inverse of horizen of cute of section value is reverse of integrate of \n operators.", "math": true, "tokens": ["partial", "over", "partial", "f", "F", "t", "variint", "text", "cohom", "D_k", "x", "ll", "p", "And", "global", "partial", "defferential", "equation", "is", "integrate", "of", "cut", "in", "cohomolgy", "and", "this", "step", "of", "defferential", "D", "brane", "of", "sheap", "value", "is", "varint", "of", "equals", "inverse", "of", "horizen", "of", "cute", "of", "section", "value", "is", "reverse", "of", "integrate", "of", "operators"], "entropy": 4.853533948577483}
{"id": 2071, "para": 794, "sentence": "Three dimension of varint of manifolds in operator of sheaps,\n and this step of times of value is equal with D-brane of equations.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Three", "dimension", "of", "varint", "of", "manifolds", "in", "operator", "of", "sheaps", "and", "this", "step", "of", "times", "of", "value", "is", "equal", "with", "D", "brane", "of", "equations"], "entropy": 3.938721875540868}
{"id": 2072, "para": 794, "sentence": "Global differential equation and integrate equation is operator of \n global scales of horizen cut and add of cut equation are routs.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Global", "differential", "equation", "and", "integrate", "equation", "is", "operator", "of", "global", "scales", "of", "horizen", "cut", "and", "add", "of", "cut", "equation", "are", "routs"], "entropy": 3.748994803525096}
