{"id": 2078, "para": 800, "sentence": "Global differential manifold is calucrate with x of x times in non\n  entropy of defferential values, and out of range in differential formula\n  be able to oneselves of global differential compute system.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Global", "differential", "manifold", "is", "calucrate", "with", "x", "of", "x", "times", "in", "non", "entropy", "of", "defferential", "values", "and", "out", "of", "range", "in", "differential", "formula", "be", "able", "to", "oneselves", "of", "global", "differential", "compute", "system"], "entropy": 4.476409765557392}
