{"id": 2104, "para": 811, "sentence": "Euler equation represet form,\n  $$ C = \\int {1 \\over x^s}dx - \\log x $$\n  $$ = \\int \\left(\\int {1 \\over x^s}dx - \\log x \\right)\\mathrm{dvol} $$\n  $$ = \\int \\int{1 \\over x^s}\\mathrm{dvol} - \\int  \\log x \\mathrm{dvol} $$\n  This equation componet of $ \\text{Higgs equation + Euler equation =\n  Zeta function} $.", "math": true, "tokens": ["Euler", "equation", "represet", "form", "C", "int", "1", "over", "x", "s", "dx", "log", "x", "int", "left", "int", "1", "over", "x", "s", "dx", "log", "x", "right", "mathrm", "dvol", "int", "int", "1", "over", "x", "s", "mathrm", "dvol", "int", "log", "x", "mathrm", "dvol", "This", "equation", "componet", "of", "text", "Higgs", "equation", "Euler", "equation", "Zeta", "function"], "entropy": 4.2128786893420305}
