{"id": 2131, "para": 820, "sentence": "$$ \\int x^y dx_m = \\begin{pmatrix} u & v \\\\\n  w & z \\end{pmatrix}^{\\begin{pmatrix} x & y \\\\\n  a & b \\end{pmatrix}} = x^y  $$\n  $$ \\begin{pmatrix} u & v \\\\\n  w & z \\end{pmatrix}^{\\begin{pmatrix}a & b \\\\\nc & d \\end{pmatrix}^{\\begin{pmatrix}x & y \\\\\n  a & b \\end{pmatrix}}} \\cong  \\begin{pmatrix} u & v \\\\\n  w & z \\end{pmatrix}^{\\begin{pmatrix} x & y \\\\\ne & f \\end{pmatrix}^{\\begin{pmatrix} a & b \\\\\n  c & d \\end{pmatrix}}} $$\n  $$ \\begin{pmatrix} u & v \\\\\n  w & y \\end{pmatrix}^{\\begin{pmatrix} x & v \\\\\na & b \\end{pmatrix}} \\cong \\begin{pmatrix} x & y \\\\\n  a & b \\end{pmatrix} $$\n    Differential geomerty of quantum level euqaiton is Gamma function equals.", "math": true, "tokens": ["int", "x", "y", "dx_m", "begin", "pmatrix", "u", "v", "w", "z", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "x", "y", "a", "b", "end", "pmatrix", "x", "y", "begin", "pmatrix", "u", "v", "w", "z", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "a", "b", "c", "d", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "x", "y", "a", "b", "end", "pmatrix", "cong", "begin", "pmatrix", "u", "v", "w", "z", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "x", "y", "e", "f", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "a", "b", "c", "d", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "u", "v", "w", "y", "end", "pmatrix", "begin", "pmatrix", "x", "v", "a", "b", "end", "pmatrix", "cong", "begin", "pmatrix", "x", "y", "a", "b", "end", "pmatrix", "Differential", "geomerty", "of", "quantum", "level", "euqaiton", "is", "Gamma", "function", "equals"], "entropy": 4.059033302543372}
