{"id": 2335, "para": 870, "sentence": "828} = a^{a + b^{b + c^{c + d^{d \\cdots }}}} $$\n  $$ = \\int e^f \\cdot x^{1 - t}dx $$\n  This represent is Gamma function in Euler product.", "math": true, "tokens": ["828", "a", "a", "b", "b", "c", "c", "d", "d", "cdots", "int", "e", "f", "cdot", "x", "1", "t", "dx", "This", "represent", "is", "Gamma", "function", "in", "Euler", "product"], "entropy": 4.3927474104487825}
