{"id": 2454, "para": 900, "sentence": "素数分布論が、ゼータ関数を開集合として同型でもあり、ノルム空間、経路積分\n   として、位相差が原子間力にもなっている。", "math": false, "tokens": ["素数分布論が", "ゼータ関数を開集合として同型でもあり", "ノルム空間", "経路積分", "として", "位相差が原子間力にもなっている"], "entropy": 2.584962500721156}
{"id": 2455, "para": 900, "sentence": "このエネルギー分布が、\n   素数と素粒子方程式、宇宙と異次元のフェルミオンとして、一致している。", "math": false, "tokens": ["このエネルギー分布が", "素数と素粒子方程式", "宇宙と異次元のフェルミオンとして", "一致している"], "entropy": 2.0}
{"id": 2456, "para": 900, "sentence": "このエネルギー分布が、複素多様体である。", "math": false, "tokens": ["このエネルギー分布が", "複素多様体である"], "entropy": 1.0}
{"id": 2457, "para": 900, "sentence": "$$\\square = 2 (\\cos (i x \\log x) + i \\sin(i x \\log x) $$", "math": true, "tokens": ["square", "2", "cos", "i", "x", "log", "x", "i", "sin", "i", "x", "log", "x"], "entropy": 2.5654483718208256}
{"id": 2458, "para": 901, "sentence": "宇宙と異次元が、双対性として、超対称性の素粒子を形成している。", "math": false, "tokens": ["宇宙と異次元が", "双対性として", "超対称性の素粒子を形成している"], "entropy": 1.584962500721156}
{"id": 2459, "para": 902, "sentence": "[reference Lisa Randall, Toshihide Masuoka, Makoto Kobayashi]", "math": false, "tokens": ["reference", "Lisa", "Randall", "Toshihide", "Masuoka", "Makoto", "Kobayashi"], "entropy": 2.807354922057604}
{"id": 2460, "para": 903, "sentence": "\\newpage\n\\title{WSL are replaced with Brigde level of surface \\\\\nWindows and Linux native code of being installed \\\\\nwith aspective surface on Windows}\n\\author{Masaaki Yamaguchi}", "math": false, "tokens": ["newpage", "title", "WSL", "are", "replaced", "with", "Brigde", "level", "of", "surface", "Windows", "and", "Linux", "native", "code", "of", "being", "installed", "with", "aspective", "surface", "on", "Windows", "author", "Masaaki", "Yamaguchi"], "entropy": 4.392747410448783}
{"id": 2461, "para": 904, "sentence": "バーチャルマシンにOSを入れて、XserverでLinuxを使うか、WSLでLinuxを使うか\n   の今では、どちらかを選択することになるが、私のアイデアでは、ハードウェアレベルでデュアルブートで、Windows側では、表として、\n   裏ではLinuxを入れるのは、VMwareと同じだが、根本的に違うのは、Windows側でブリッジをホライズンブリッジにして、\n　　その裏にLinuxが存在しているコンピュータを考えている。", "math": false, "tokens": ["バーチャルマシンに", "OS", "を入れて", "Xserver", "で", "Linux", "を使うか", "WSL", "で", "Linux", "を使うか", "の今では", "どちらかを選択することになるが", "私のアイデアでは", "ハードウェアレベルでデュアルブートで", "Windows", "側では", "表として", "裏では", "Linux", "を入れるのは", "VMware", "と同じだが", "根本的に違うのは", "Windows", "側でブリッジをホライズンブリッジにして", "その裏に", "Linux", "が存在しているコンピュータを考えている"], "entropy": 4.375222374437917}
{"id": 2462, "para": 904, "sentence": "この方法だと、バイナリだろうがソースコードだろうがネイティブの\n　　OSが味わえられる。", "math": false, "tokens": ["この方法だと", "バイナリだろうがソースコードだろうがネイティブの", "OS", "が味わえられる"], "entropy": 2.0}
{"id": 2463, "para": 904, "sentence": "Tab+Windowskeyで、仮想空間に存在している他人のネットワークにあるOSが3D地図になり、経路としてのrout経脈が見えて、\n　　その末端にあるOSにアクセスできる。", "math": false, "tokens": ["Tab", "Windowskey", "で", "仮想空間に存在している他人のネットワークにある", "OS", "が", "3D", "地図になり", "経路としての", "rout", "経脈が見えて", "その末端にある", "OS", "にアクセスできる"], "entropy": 3.6644977792004623}
{"id": 2464, "para": 904, "sentence": "これがウルトラネットワークである。", "math": false, "tokens": ["これがウルトラネットワークである"], "entropy": 0.0}
{"id": 2465, "para": 904, "sentence": "Surface on Windows off Linuxの構成は、WindowsとLinuxをキー操作だけで、\n　表面のWindowsと裏のLinuxが自由自在に使える。", "math": false, "tokens": ["Surface", "on", "Windows", "off", "Linux", "の構成は", "Windows", "と", "Linux", "をキー操作だけで", "表面の", "Windows", "と裏の", "Linux", "が自由自在に使える"], "entropy": 3.2729055953200556}
{"id": 2466, "para": 904, "sentence": "WSLのSystemとは違う仕組みになっている。", "math": false, "tokens": ["WSL", "の", "System", "とは違う仕組みになっている"], "entropy": 2.0}
{"id": 2467, "para": 904, "sentence": "このアイデアが以下の説明で端的に表されている。", "math": false, "tokens": ["このアイデアが以下の説明で端的に表されている"], "entropy": 0.0}
{"id": 2468, "para": 905, "sentence": "The idea is virtualmachine live with dualboot mode in hardware level,\n   and this environment OS confusion surface with Windows and Linux.", "math": false, "tokens": ["The", "idea", "is", "virtualmachine", "live", "with", "dualboot", "mode", "in", "hardware", "level", "and", "this", "environment", "OS", "confusion", "surface", "with", "Windows", "and", "Linux"], "entropy": 4.201841232302569}
{"id": 2469, "para": 905, "sentence": "Therefore this complex OS combinate on Windows aspect with Hardware switch, \n   This surface level of Windows convert with bridge level in Linux of non\n   surface, and this bridge level combinart with data of virtual machine,\n   the controll with bridge aspect off being Linux would seen with\n   Windows on surface aspective of ground level controll in taskbar.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Therefore", "this", "complex", "OS", "combinate", "on", "Windows", "aspect", "with", "Hardware", "switch", "This", "surface", "level", "of", "Windows", "convert", "with", "bridge", "level", "in", "Linux", "of", "non", "surface", "and", "this", "bridge", "level", "combinart", "with", "data", "of", "virtual", "machine", "the", "controll", "with", "bridge", "aspect", "off", "being", "Linux", "would", "seen", "with", "Windows", "on", "surface", "aspective", "of", "ground", "level", "controll", "in", "taskbar"], "entropy": 4.845313797398192}
{"id": 2470, "para": 905, "sentence": "This taskbar insentate with application protocol into gateway protocol\n   of X being used for Windows level of aspect in hardware.", "math": false, "tokens": ["This", "taskbar", "insentate", "with", "application", "protocol", "into", "gateway", "protocol", "of", "X", "being", "used", "for", "Windows", "level", "of", "aspect", "in", "hardware"], "entropy": 4.1219280948873624}
{"id": 2471, "para": 906, "sentence": "These informate of Hardware of combinate with Windows and Linux\n   confusion on OS boot for X server like Astec-X and VMware,\n   WSL application replace with this bridge and gateway and application\n   protocol being used of surface of aspective level on hardware being seen\n   like in already install and use for replace of VMware and X servers.", "math": false, "tokens": ["These", "informate", "of", "Hardware", "of", "combinate", "with", "Windows", "and", "Linux", "confusion", "on", "OS", "boot", "for", "X", "server", "like", "Astec", "X", "and", "VMware", "WSL", "application", "replace", "with", "this", "bridge", "and", "gateway", "and", "application", "protocol", "being", "used", "of", "surface", "of", "aspective", "level", "on", "hardware", "being", "seen", "like", "in", "already", "install", "and", "use", "for", "replace", "of", "VMware", "and", "X", "servers"], "entropy": 4.992989961867771}
{"id": 2472, "para": 907, "sentence": "This idea is merit that WSL build with OS level transport on Windows,\n   and this idea that surface preinstall of aspective Windows after this\n   setting of Linux, double OS in native OS true, then Windows aspect of\n   being used with Linux native, this Linux is user oneself level\n   being setting with.", "math": false, "tokens": ["This", "idea", "is", "merit", "that", "WSL", "build", "with", "OS", "level", "transport", "on", "Windows", "and", "this", "idea", "that", "surface", "preinstall", "of", "aspective", "Windows", "after", "this", "setting", "of", "Linux", "double", "OS", "in", "native", "OS", "true", "then", "Windows", "aspect", "of", "being", "used", "with", "Linux", "native", "this", "Linux", "is", "user", "oneself", "level", "being", "setting", "with"], "entropy": 4.838517008383638}
{"id": 2473, "para": 908, "sentence": "And This Linux of aspective hardware after Windows installed,\n   and this user level install of Linux like Ubuntu Debian Kali, Red hat\n   linux, this linux are handware of Windows aspective level on surface.", "math": false, "tokens": ["And", "This", "Linux", "of", "aspective", "hardware", "after", "Windows", "installed", "and", "this", "user", "level", "install", "of", "Linux", "like", "Ubuntu", "Debian", "Kali", "Red", "hat", "linux", "this", "linux", "are", "handware", "of", "Windows", "aspective", "level", "on", "surface"], "entropy": 4.5366702556565315}
