{"id": 2534, "para": 925, "sentence": "These two chains are one class of spectrum zones.", "math": false, "tokens": ["These", "two", "chains", "are", "one", "class", "of", "spectrum", "zones"], "entropy": 3.169925001442312}
{"id": 2535, "para": 925, "sentence": "More also this two of metal chains are Toliraphone and Whipacs.", "math": false, "tokens": ["More", "also", "this", "two", "of", "metal", "chains", "are", "Toliraphone", "and", "Whipacs"], "entropy": 3.459431618637298}
{"id": 2536, "para": 925, "sentence": "Toliraphone is same with Tell, Whipacs is Selen chemistry.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Toliraphone", "is", "same", "with", "Tell", "Whipacs", "is", "Selen", "chemistry"], "entropy": 2.94770277922009}
{"id": 2537, "para": 925, "sentence": "I tendency have to be like see a beautifll formed of selen organic \n   chemistry geinu to out of world.", "math": false, "tokens": ["I", "tendency", "have", "to", "be", "like", "see", "a", "beautifll", "formed", "of", "selen", "organic", "chemistry", "geinu", "to", "out", "of", "world"], "entropy": 4.03740119765411}
