{"id": 2652, "para": 947, "sentence": "Life of water and \nLife of tree is existed with central of universe, and around of universe is old of universe and \nthis space is creating with any other dimension of creature.", "math": false, "tokens": ["Life", "of", "water", "and", "Life", "of", "tree", "is", "existed", "with", "central", "of", "universe", "and", "around", "of", "universe", "is", "old", "of", "universe", "and", "this", "space", "is", "creating", "with", "any", "other", "dimension", "of", "creature"], "entropy": 3.944548827786958}
