{"id": 3013, "para": 1047, "sentence": "And these calyement equation excluded into pair of dimension surface.", "math": false, "tokens": ["And", "these", "calyement", "equation", "excluded", "into", "pair", "of", "dimension", "surface"], "entropy": 3.321928094887362}
