{"id": 3081, "para": 1063, "sentence": "D-brane and anti-D-brane is composited with all of series universe emerged for one geometry of \ndimension, this gravity of power from D-brane and anti-D-brane emelite with ancestor.", "math": false, "tokens": ["D", "brane", "and", "anti", "D", "brane", "is", "composited", "with", "all", "of", "series", "universe", "emerged", "for", "one", "geometry", "of", "dimension", "this", "gravity", "of", "power", "from", "D", "brane", "and", "anti", "D", "brane", "emelite", "with", "ancestor"], "entropy": 4.233639952626228}
