{"id": 3162, "para": 1093, "sentence": "$$ X \\dotsi \\to Y, Y \\dotsi \\to X $$\n   $$ \\bigoplus(i \\hbar^{\\nabla})^{\\oplus L} = e^{-x \\log x} $$\n   This equation of quantum level of differential geomerty\n   instimate with entorpy of non exchange equation.", "math": true, "tokens": ["X", "dotsi", "to", "Y", "Y", "dotsi", "to", "X", "bigoplus", "i", "hbar", "nabla", "oplus", "L", "e", "x", "log", "x", "This", "equation", "of", "quantum", "level", "of", "differential", "geomerty", "instimate", "with", "entorpy", "of", "non", "exchange", "equation"], "entropy": 4.5366702556565315}
